WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
The activity log records every change, sign-in and export, with the person and the time.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.160
The activity log records every change, sign-in and export in the office.

3
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:19.900
Each line shows who, what they did, and when. Click the record to open it.

4
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:25.270
Choose a person to see only what they did.

5
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:36.640
Nobody can edit the log from the office, so it is a record you can rely on.

6
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:42.150
Changes to people's access have their own detailed history under Users & permissions.
